  "historyNote": "#4425, eff 5-27-88; ss by #4946, eff 10-2-90; EXPIRED: 10-2-96 New. #6634, eff 11-25-97; ss by #8242, eff 12-30-04; ss by #9172, eff 6-6-08; ss by #12033, eff 11-3-16",
